&Q000465 = A tigi (?) to Ninurta for Išme-Dagan (Išme-Dagan O)
@composite
#project: etcslatf/inter
#atf: use unicode
#atf: use math
#etcsl: text-id=c.2.5.4.15
#key: after http://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/cgi-bin/etcsl.cgi?text=c.2.5.4.15&display=Crit&charenc=gcirc#

@div version 1 (Version A)

@div segment A

@div sa-gida A

1.A.A.1. [ur-saŋ] gal a₂ gal an ki-a
#lem: ursaŋ[warrior]; gal[big]; a[arm]; gal[big]; an[sky]; ki[place]
#tr.en: Great hero, strongest in heaven and earth! @wDN{Ninurta}, who controls perfectly the fifty divine powers in the @wTN{E-kur}! 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.1

1.A.A.2. {[d]}[nin-urta] e₂-kur-ra me 50 šu du₇
#lem: Ninurtak[1]DN; Ekur[1]TN; me[Being]; n; šu[hand]; du[perfect]
#tr.en: …… governor for his father, rising raging storm, who extends terror …… towards the foreign countries. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.2

1.A.A.3. [X X] X ensi₂ a-a-na u₁₈-lu sumur zig₃-ga
#lem: X; X; X; ensik[ruler]; aya[father]; ulu[south wind]; sumur[angry]; zig[rise]
#tr.en: …… roaring ……, who casts fear upon the people, 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.3

1.A.A.4. [X X] kur#-še₃ ni₂ gid₂-gid₂-i
#lem: X; X; kur[mountain(s)]; ni[self]; gid[long]
#tr.en: who has no rival! @wDN{Ninurta}, surpassing in vigour! …… great and majestic strength ……, 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.4

1.A.A.5. [X X] X ZU X gu₃ nun di GAN DIM₂
#lem: X; X; X; X; X; gu[voice]; nun[prince]; di[speak]; X; X
#tr.en: …… of @wDN{Enlil}, …… of @wDN{Enlil}, ornament of the august shrine! 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.5

1.A.A.6. [ni₂ su]-a ru-ru-gu₂ gaba-šu-ŋar nu-tuku
#lem: ni[fear]; su[flesh]; rugu[withstand]; gabašuŋar[rival]; tuku[acquire]
#tr.en: …… whose radiance ……! 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.6

1.A.A.7. {[d]}[nin]-urta nam-šul-a dirig-ga
#lem: Ninurtak[1]DN; namšul[manhood]; dirig[make more than]
#tr.en: …… the neck-stock of the gods. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.7

1.A.A.8. [X X] usu gal mah X X zi-i-zi
#lem: X; X; usu[strength]; gal[big]; mah[great]; X; X; zig[rise]
#tr.en: …… among the @wDN{Anuna} gods. …… exceptionally mighty ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.8

1.A.A.9. [X X] MU UN nam {d}en-lil₂-la₂
#lem: X; X; X; X; nam[fate]; Enlil[1]DN
#tr.en: …… lord, the son of @wDN{Enlil}, 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.9

1.A.A.10. [...] {d}en-lil₂-ka he₂-du₇ eš₃ mah-a
#lem: X; Enlil[1]DN; hedu[ornament]; eš[shrine]; mah[great]
#tr.en: who has come forth from the hills, and rides (?) upon the numerous divine powers. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.10

1.A.A.11. [...] me-lem₄ X X X X ŋal₂
#lem: X; melim[frightening splendor]; X; X; X; X; ŋal[⟦be⟧ to be (there]
#tr.en: …… great hero, surpassing dragon, perfect lord, …… without rival (?)! 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.11

1.A.A.12. [...] X E X X X X X
#lem: X; X; X; X; X; X; X; X
#tr.en: Great hero confident in his strength! 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.12

1.A.A.13. [...] {[ŋiš]}[rab₃] diŋir-re-e-ne
#lem: X; raba[clamp]; diŋir[deity]
#tr.en: ……, whose decisions cannot be countermanded, …… what he says is firm. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.13

1.A.A.14. [...] X X X X
#lem: X; X; X; X; X
#tr.en: …… august son of @wDN{Enlil}! …… overpowers (?) the mountains, 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.14

1.A.A.15. [...] {[d]}a-nun-ke₄-ne
#lem: X; Anunak[1]DN
#tr.en: …… the Great Mountain @wDN{Enlil} …… in the @wTN{E-kur}, 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.15

1.A.A.16. [...] a₂-nun-ŋal₂ mah-bi
#lem: X; anunŋal[strong]; mah[great]
#tr.en: throughout the entire extent of heaven and earth. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.16

1.A.A.17. [...] X en dumu {d}en-lil₂-la₂
#lem: X; X; en[lord]; dumu[child]; Enlil[1]DN
#tr.en: …… his great …… covers ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.17

1.A.A.18. [hur-saŋ-ta] e₃-a me šar₂-ra u₅ X
#lem: hursaŋ[mountain]; e[leave]; me[Being]; šar[numerous]V/i; u[ride]; X
#tr.en: …… raging ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.18

1.A.A.19. [X X] ur-saŋ gal ušum zag dib
#lem: X; X; ursaŋ[warrior]; gal[big]; ušum[snake]; zag[side]; dib[pass]
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.19

1.A.A.20. [nam]-en#-na šu du₇ e-ne-da X nu-sa₂
#lem: namen[the office of en-priest]; šu[hand]; du[perfect]; ane[he]; X; sa[equal]
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.20

1.A.A.21. [ur-saŋ] gal# ne₃-ni-da nir-ŋal₂
#lem: ursaŋ[warrior]; gal[big]; ne[strength]; nirŋal[authoritative]
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.21

1.A.A.22. [X X] GI RU iri BA RI X X
#lem: X; X; X; X; iri[city]; X; X; X; X
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.22

1.A.A.23. [... eš]-bar nu-kam₃-me
#lem: X; ešbar[decision]; kam[alter]
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.23

1.A.A.24. [...] dug₄-ga-ni ki-bi-še₃ ŋar
#lem: X; dug[speak]; ki[place]; ŋar[put]
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.24

1.A.A.25. [...] dumu mah {d}en-lil₂-la₂
#lem: X; dumu[child]; mah[great]; Enlil[1]DN
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.25

1.A.A.26. [...] X X kur-še₃ šu ša-an-ša
#lem: X; X; X; kur[mountain(s)]; šu[hand]; šanšaša[cvve]
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.26

1.A.A.27. [X X kur] gal {d}en-lil₂ e₂-kur-ra an ki niŋ₂-daŋal-ba
#lem: X; X; kur[mountain(s)]; gal[big]; Enlil[1]DN; Ekur[1]TN; an[sky]; ki[place]; niŋdaŋala[vastness]
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.27

1.A.A.28. [...]-ba mah-a-ni dul-la
#lem: X; mah[great]; dul[cover]
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.28

1.A.A.29. [X X] X sumur X [...]
#lem: X; X; X; sumur[angry]; X; X
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.29

1.A.A.30. [...] SU X [...]
#lem: X; X; X; X
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.30

$ (up to 8 lines missing)
@end sa-gida

@end segment

@div segment B

@div sa-gida B

1.B.B.1. inim-ma-ni kal-kal-a-[am₃]
#lem: inim[word]; kal[rare]
#tr.en: His words are precious, and what he says is true. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.B.B.1

1.B.B.2. dug₄-ga-ni zid-da-am₃#
#lem: dug[speak]; zid[right]
#tr.en: @wDN{Ninurta}, lion raging against the disobedient! 
#etcsl: line-id=1.B.B.2

1.B.B.3. {d}nin-urta piriŋ sumur nu-še-ga#
#lem: Ninurtak[1]DN; piriŋ[lion]; sumur[angry]; šeg[agree]
#tr.en: Authoritative one, 
#etcsl: line-id=1.B.B.3

1.B.B.4. nir-ŋal₂ kur gam-gam X [...] X
#lem: nirŋal[authoritative]; kur[mountain(s)]; gurum[bend]; X; X; X
#tr.en: who makes the foreign countries submit ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.B.B.4

@div trailer 

1.B.B.5. sa-gid₂-da-[am₃]
#lem: sagida[musical notation]
#tr.en: @fsux{Sa-gida}. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.B.B.5

@end trailer

@end sa-gida

@div ŋišgiŋal C

1.B.C.6. {d}nin-urta {d}iš-me-{d}[da-gan ...]
#lem: Ninurtak[1]DN; Išmedagan[1]RN; X
#tr.en: May @wDN{Ninurta} look upon @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}}  
#etcsl: line-id=1.B.C.6

1.B.C.7. igi nam-til₃-la hu-mu#-[ši-in-bar]
#lem: igi[eye]; namtil[life]; bar[place outside]
#tr.en: …… with a life-giving gaze! 
#etcsl: line-id=1.B.C.7

@div trailer 

1.B.C.8. ŋiš-gi₄-ŋal₂ sa-gid₂-[da-bi-im]
#lem: ŋešgiŋal[musical refrain]; sagida[musical notation]
#tr.en: Its @fsux{ŋišgiŋal} of the @fsux{sa-gida}. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.B.C.8

@end trailer

@end ŋišgiŋal

@div unknown D

1.B.D.9. u₄-ta-u₁₈-lu i-lim u₅ [X X]
#lem: Utaʾulu[1]; ilim[radiance]; u[ride]; X; X
#tr.en: @wDN{Uta-ulu}, riding on fearsome radiance ……, greatest amongst the great lords ……! @wDN{Ninurta}, perfect in authority, caretaker of heaven and earth ……, lord who was given strength by @wDN{Nunamnir}, confident in his strength ……! @wDN{Ninurta}, foremost ……! @wDN{Enlil} ……! …… like a butting bull! …… your foot on the disobedient! Great hero ……! …… the distant hills! …… the enemy lands into the king's hands! @wDN{Ninurta}, …… helper of @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}} in the mêlée! …… his majestic weapon! …… the rebellious, disobedient land! …… his majestic mace the enemy! …… battle …… enemy! May …… @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}} ……! 
#etcsl: line-id=1.B.D.9

1.B.D.10. en gal-e-ne dirig X [X X]
#lem: en[lord]; gal[big]; dirig[make more than]; X; X; X
#etcsl: line-id=1.B.D.10

